      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3405401-015",
      "text": "Although smart contracting in decentralized systems is perceived as creating trust through preordained coded coordination without agency problems, decentralized commerce is equally afflicted with trust issues.",
