    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3405401-015:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "While smart contracting in decentralized system can be perceived as creating trust through mathematical and coded — preordained coordination without agency problems, several factors suggest that decentralized commerce via decentralized solutions is equally afflicted with trust issues.",
