      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3405401-016",
      "text": "Trust between counterparties in decentralized systems can only limitedly be assured by smart contracts, because the contract cannot verify the underlying qualities or future conduct of the parties.",
