      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3782201-026",
      "text": "Aragon's refusal to use its own protocol to arbitrate an internal dispute is testimony to the lack of trust its own system designers place in their system's capabilities, and its reputation and legislative and judicial governance protocols remain trivial.",
