      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3799320-024",
      "text": "The DAO of DAOs uses a duality of internal and external governance: internal governance runs on reputation token staking, while external legal relationships are handled by a legal wrapper that represents the DAO of DAOs in real world legal contexts.",
