      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3799320-028",
      "text": "Reputation based staking removes the corruptive elements of fungible tokens because third parties are less likely able to take over a non fungible asset such as reputation that is organically grown and maintained through actual expertise in the relevant subject matter.",
