    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3799320-028:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "The corruptive elements of fungible assets/tokens are removed because third parties are less likely able to take over a non-fungible asset, such as reputation, that is organically grown and maintained through actual expertise in a given DAO subject matter.",
