      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/3799320-029",
      "text": "Reputation voting has two advantages over one token one vote: it is non fungible, which avoids corruptive elements, and it aligns incentives for members individually and for the institution as a whole at the same time.",
