    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:3799320-030:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "1. the non-fungible reputation tokens give DAO of DAOs members voting rights, and 2. fungible reputation salary tokens allow DAO of DAOs members to earn a fungible salary in proportion to their non-fungible reputation tokens.",
