    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:4067783-033:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "Despite its advances in innovation for redefining work outcomes, Braintrust uses a suboptimal governance model with a one token, one vote system for proportional control over how the network is governed.",
