      "type": "Claim",
      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/4529715-032",
      "text": "A reputation system that rewards voting with the majority, as Bridge Mutual uses, can be manipulated by users who create multiple wallets and always vote with the majority.",
