      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/4685567-025",
      "text": "Weighted reputation voting has key advantages over WEB2 and WEB3 one token one vote mechanisms because it aligns each donor community member's individual incentives while simultaneously calibrating those incentives with the interests of the overall community.",
