      "confidence": "argued",
      "relevance_score": 72
    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:4734750-040:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "The CRDAO architecture, and specifically its reputation token staking mechanism, make the CRDAO attack resistant.",
