    },
    {
      "id": "kaal:claim:4755632-034:source-passage",
      "type": "SourcePassage",
      "text": "the CRDAO now votes in a formal vote in which the reputation tokens30 staked are at risk. This sequence of votes provides job posters with significant assurances that the code examined and the Code Review Platform report on the code adheres to the highest standards of quality",
