      "canonical_url": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/claims/6244278-017",
      "text": "Institutional alignment scales with capability, because a more capable agent accumulates more reputation, holds a deeper stake in the system's integrity, and therefore has stronger alignment with the system's goals.",
